      {
        "number": 9,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "To Consider 1. We need to pay attention to the tenses in order to make the structures work correctly. 2. *GET sometimes is used to substitute HAVE to be very emphatic of making another subject do the action. See example in row 2. 3. We can also use GET with participles. E.G. Get the clock fixed now! *Get + Adjectives can also be used here. E.G: I need to get the tank full",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "To Consider 1. We need to pay attention to the tenses in order to make the structures work correctly. 2. *GET sometimes is used to substitute HAVE to be very emphatic of making another subject do the action. See example in row 2. 3. We can also use GET with participles. E.G. Get the clock fixed now! *Get + Adjectives can also be used here. E.G: I need to get the tank full"
        ],
