        "number": 11,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "Working with these structures we can have some functions.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Working with these structures we can have some functions.",
          "Functions Examples 1 State things people do for others Jill had John call Mary to apologize. I will have Annie finish this pie tonight. 2 Talk about things done in our behalf or for us The school had the hall painted by the students. We will have the speech addressed by Joshua. 3 Give instructions John, please, get it to work. We need the coffee maker.",
          "To consider We need to remember that there are many other ways in which we can ask or have others do things for us, like using modals to be polite: Could you please open this for me?"
        ],
